"saga lowers the hood underneath is a face like clear crystal flickering at the edges": "p01_286_narrator",
"i am a ystran echo i came in the mother pod and lived twenty years in a borrowed human shape guarding the vortex secret": "p01_287_saga",
"the one who launched your little scout liss is my sister": "p01_288_saga",
"zib flashes every color at once so that was the word saga whispered at the summit": "p01_289_narrator",
"tamsin finds a ruined room covered in star charts the ystran explorers map room": "p01_290_narrator",
"on the wall is a symbol shaped exactly like the question mark on her vest": "p01_291_narrator",
"that word means the place we haven t found yet": "p01_292_saga",
"tamsin sits down on the floor and laughs until she cries": "p01_293_narrator",
"forty years forty years i ve been looking for this i think i ll stay a while": "p01_294_tamsin",
"the forest is gray and silent here small shadow creatures creep out of the dead trees and swarm toward you": "p01_295_narrator",
"your team braces for a fight then you see it they aren t attacking": "p01_296_narrator",
"they re reaching for your light they re begging": "p01_297_narrator",
"the ground simply stops beyond it is a darkness so complete it has no shape": "p02_298_narrator",
"something enormous is breathing inside it": "p02_299_narrator",
"oblivane is calm at last small and silver light returns to ystra s sky but the land stays bare the job isn t finished": "p02_300_narrator",
"now the heartroot s crater before its light goes out": "p03_301_liss",
"kit s shard relay and static s frequency send the call home to kessler": "p03_302_narrator",
"above the crater the warp gate wakes for the first time and opens a road between the worlds": "p03_303_narrator",
"and they come through it hank captain marsh dj static ingrid old basalt echo and iris kade every trainer you ever battled even pell": "p03_304_narrator",
"wild alienmon of every kind pour through the gate behind them": "p03_305_narrator",
"every alienmon sings one note of her song nobody gives up their body or their life only a note every one of them stays itself": "p03_306_narrator",
"the heartroot drinks the song green floods out across ystra": "p03_307_narrator",
"a world tree of crystal and leaves rises out of the crater the seedmother growing again": "p03_308_narrator",
"she holds oblivane small and silver now like a moon in her branches": "p03_309_narrator",
"thank you my children every one of you still yourselves": "p03_310_seedmother",
"take this seed the gate will stay open a road between your two homes": "p03_311_seedmother",
"the warp gate is still open on every scope in the system go and see it from our side": "p04_312_vashti",
"the warp gate s runes blaze cyan and pink a road between two worlds open at last": "p04_313_narrator"
